{"id":"vod_sn_37784","vodId":"37784","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"草莓百分百","name_cn":"草莓百分百","date":"2005-01-01","year":"2005","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/8ed67a8867a4e396d353bfd8c3ce6222.jpg"},"summary":"一次偶然中，真中淳平（铃村健一 配音）在学校的天台上发现了一位身穿草莓内裤的陌生少女，凭借着草莓内裤这一重要信息，被少女美貌迷住的淳平决心在茫茫人海之中将少女找到。功夫不负有心人，淳平终于将目标锁定在了名为西野司（丰口惠美 配音）的校园偶像身上，然而，她真的就是当初那位少女吗？　　原来，少女真正的名字叫做东城绫（能登麻美子 配音），不知真相的淳平却也渐渐的被东城所吸引，可惜此时的他已经和西野确定了恋爱关系。文化祭即将到来，淳平决定拍摄一个短篇作为作品，东城、北大路五月（小林沙苗 配音）、南户唯（水树奈奈 配音）等好友亦来帮忙，在准备作品的这段日子里，一段充满了纠葛的感情在这些人之间展开了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:55:28","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3FUQvy3PuT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1nV3YyixjH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Fn69isqnEs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Rj3qX1FF1c1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PajFTfRL0E1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/i1GmhTPAHr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/A6qW9u2jKC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Zr359xsSfk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/arWAkVxFFd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XYHLRRhDwW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sErPXaDKgq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iF9SVkETbK1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:06.666Z"}